MISSION: FAST.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Example 09 — Compiling PlantLang to a native binary
#
#  Run interpreted:     chloroplast run     examples/09_compile.plnt
#  Compile (LLVM, auto): chloroplast compile examples/09_compile.plnt --run
#  Force the C backend:  chloroplast compile examples/09_compile.plnt --backend c --run
#  Keep intermediate files: add --keep-c (keeps .ll/.opt.ll/.s or .c)
#
#  As of v0.22.0, `compile` auto-detects an LLVM toolchain (llc + opt) and
#  uses it by default — the same backend architecture as Rust, Swift, and
#  Julia. Falls back to the direct-to-C backend if no llc is found.
#
#  Supported for compilation (both backends):
#    CREATE/SET/INCREASE/DECREASE (NUM, SCL, TX, FACT)
#    SHOW (literals, identifiers, + concatenation)
#    IF / ORIF / ELSE
#    CYCLE var FROM lo TO hi [STEP k]
#    SEASON (while loop)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1\ SHOW "=== FizzBuzz ===".
1\ CYCLE i FROM 1 TO 20,
2\   IF i GREATER THAN 0,
3\     SHOW i.
2\.
1\.

1\ SHOW "".
1\ SHOW "=== Sum of squares 1..10 ===".
1\ CREATE sum(NUM) TO 0.
1\ CYCLE n FROM 1 TO 10,
2\   CREATE sq(NUM) TO n * n.
2\   INCREASE sum BY sq.
1\.
1\ SHOW sum.

1\ SHOW "".
1\ SHOW "=== Countdown ===".
1\ CREATE t(NUM) TO 5.
1\ SEASON t GREATER THAN 0,
2\   SHOW t.
2\   DECREASE t BY 1.
1\.
1\ SHOW "Liftoff!".

1\ SHOW "".
1\ SHOW "=== Temperature check ===".
1\ CREATE temp(SCL) TO 37.8.
1\ IF temp GREATER THAN 38.0,
2\   SHOW "Fever".
1\ ORIF temp GREATER THAN OR EQUAL 36.0,
2\   SHOW "Normal".
1\ ELSE,
2\   SHOW "Low".
1\.
